BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Shall We Dance
DTSTART:20250606T230000Z
DTEND:20250607T014000Z
DTSTAMP:20250606T230000Z
UID:TtijWvuWAv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 137 mins (2h17m)\n\nShohei Sugiyama (Koji Yakusho) s
 eems to have it all - a high-paying job as an accountant\, a beautiful hom
 e\, a caring wife and a doting daughter he loves dearly. However\, he feel
 s something is missing in his life. One day while commuting on the train h
 e spots a beautiful woman staring wistfully out a window and eventually de
 cides to find her. His search leads him head-first into the world of compe
 titive ballroom dancing.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/shall-
 we-dance\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Fri 6 June
 \, 7:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2 (Sat 7 June\, 1:00 PM)\n  
 • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2 (Sat 7 June\, 7:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema U
 ptown House 1 (Sun 8 June\, 4:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Su
 n 8 June\, 7:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Mon 9 June\, 4:00 P
 M)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Mon 9 June\, 7:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Ci
 nema Uptown House 1 (Tue 10 June\, 4:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown Hous
 e 1 (Tue 10 June\, 7:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Wed 11 June
 \, 4:00 PM)\n  • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Wed 11 June\, 7:00 PM)\n  
 • SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1 (Thu 12 June\, 4:00 PM)
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
